{"id": "242174", "name": "מציאת בסיס מתוך קבוצה ב-R^3", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "randvervectnonzero", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[0]),n))"}, {"name": "randhorvect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "matrix(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "dezero", "params": ["vec", "n", "k"], "body": "if (zeromatrixp(vec)) then randvervectnonzero(n,k) else vec"}, {"name": "dezerolst", "params": ["veclst", "k"], "body": "map(lambda([vec], dezero(vec, length(vec),k)), veclst)"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}, {"name": "coin", "params": ["i"], "body": "is(rand(4)>0)", "array": true}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים הוקטורים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[v_1={{CT:0}}, v_2={{CT:1}}, v_3={{CT:2}}, v_4={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו תת-קבוצה שמהווה בסיס למרחב. הזינו את תשובתכם כרשימת אינדקסים.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">דוגמה: אם אתם סבורים כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{v_1,v_3\\}\\)</span> קבוצה בלתי תלויה מקסימלית (קבוצה בת\"ל שכל אחד מהוקטורים האחרים המופיעים בשאלה תלוי בה לינארית), הזינו את הרשימה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([1,3]\\)</span>.</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: במידה ולא ניתן למצוא בסיס הזינו את הערך <b><code dir=\"ltr\">false</code></b> (לא בתוך רשימה).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "/*goodList: emptyp(delete(true,map(lambda([x],is(integerp(x) and x>0 and x<5)),ans1)));*/\nidxs: unique(ans1);\nstudmat: block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(idxs) do(mat:addcol(mat,vecs[idxs[i]])),mat);\nstudrank: rank(studmat);\n\nindependent: is(studrank = length(idxs));\nspanning: is(studrank = 3);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "false", "tans": "ans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "independent", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך אינה נכונה. תת-הקבוצה שבחרת אינה בת\"ל.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "spanning", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך אינה נכונה. אמנם בחרת בתת-קבוצה של וקטורים שהינה בת\"ל, אך היא אינה בסיס.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "emptyp(delete(true,map(lambda([x],is(integerp(x) and x>0 and x<5)),ans1)))", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הקבוצה מכילה בסיס ולא כל איברי הרשימה שהזנת הם אינדקסים בין 1 ל-4.</div>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "3", "tans": "spandim", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-5-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך לא נכונה. יש בסיס בקבוצה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-5-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך נכונה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "maxindep", "n", "spandim", "tans_ans1", "vecmat", "vecs"], "nvariants": 50}